            <span class="texto"
                >Battery, communication, connectivity, and data quality.</span
            >
        </div>
        <div class="application-item">
            <div class="title">
                <Icon name="arrow-right-2" size={24} />
                <span>Ongoing maintenance</span>
            </div>
            <span class="texto"
                >Adjustments, replacements, and expansion of the solution as the
                farm grows.</span
            >
